  "id": "edamame-corn-and-black-bean-salad",
  "name": "Edamame, Corn, and Black Bean Salad",
  "subtitle": "A bright make-ahead bean and vegetable salad",
  "description": "Tender edamame and corn join black beans, tomatoes, and green onions in a tangy lime-herb dressing.",
